    "id": "ml-tools",
    "level": 2,
    "heading": "ML tools",
    "body": "- **Model trainer:** Ludwig, PyTorch and Keras or TensorFlow, each in its own isolated environment, installed only after you accept the size and licence. Training runs as a cancellable background job on a CSV in your workspace.\n- **Cloud accounts:** AWS SageMaker, Google Vertex AI, Azure ML, DigitalOcean, RunPod and Oracle OCI Data Science. Access is **read-only by default**.\n\nAgents use these through two built-in MCP servers, `trainer` and `cloudml`, which are off until you enable them. Real training and real cloud calls have not been run by the developers, so try them with a small job first."
