    "heading": "Traces",
    "body": "Agent Studio stores spans for every Agent Studio agent (turn, then agent, then each model and tool call, with sub-agents kept as a tree) and one span per turn and tool call of each external agent. External agents are started with the OpenTelemetry settings pointing at a built-in receiver (`POST /v1/traces`, `/v1/metrics`, `/v1/logs`, on this PC only, OTLP over HTTP with JSON)."
