    "level": 2,
    "heading": "\"Refused: the spend limit would be exceeded\"",
    "body": "The worst case of the request is more than what is left under the provider's limit. Raise the limit, lower the provider's **maximum output tokens**, or use a cheaper or local model. See [Billing and limits](doc:billing-and-limits)."
